00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:18.770
<b>Nnnngh</b>

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:22.840
<i>Dr. Harada's great.</i>

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:24.240
<i>He's exciting.</i>

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:28.030
