<i>Divorce...</i>

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:44.090
He's a fourth-year at WU.

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:54.780
<b>Simplified Eye Chart (use at 3m)</b>

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:54.100
Yes, I've heard of it.

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:58.120
My aunt has the same disease.

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:02.210
It's said that half of the cause is genetics.

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:06.130
You should avoid bright lights and 
wear sunglasses when outside.

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:10.950
<i>It's a disease that causes the photo-receptor 
