00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:21.360
<i>It progresses slowly and 
can end in blindness.</i>

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:24.300
<i>Senpai, that poem...</i>

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:32.610
<i>Fujiwara no Atsutada 
The emotions experienced after a long-awaited reunion banish any lingering memories of the past</i>

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:29.510
<i>is a poem about knowledge that can
fill you with either light or darkness.</i>

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:34.320
<i>I see...</i>

00:08:35.230 --> 00:08:36.790
<i>What now, then?</i>

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:38.430
<i>How should I live my life?</i>

00:08:38.920 --> 00:08:41.990
Just be sure to make something of yourself.

00:08:41.990 --> 00:08:45.020
<i>How can I make something of myself?</i>

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:48.010
<i>As a man who's going to
go blind someday, what can I do?</i>

00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:59.790
<i>Swift waters parted by the jagged rocks</i>

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:58.170
<i>are joined at river's end</i>

00:08:58.170 --> 00:09:01.040
<i>The opponent's lower right side that 
Dr. Harada's been targeting...</i>

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:04.090
<i>That was too fast! He moved 
before it was even read!</i>

00:09:04.090 --> 00:09:05.220
<i>Isn't that a false start?!</i>

00:09:05.220 --> 00:09:08.070
<i>It's the right card, though! 
The Master knew what it was!</i>

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:13.310
<i>He knew from the air expelled 
before any sound was made...</i>

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:20.110
<i>No more can we hear the 
sounds of the waterfall</i>

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:18.570
Master Suo is starting to bounce back.

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:20.720
What's changed since the first half?

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:22.570
As more cards are read,

00:09:22.570 --> 00:09:25.590
it lowers the time taken to reach
the unique syllables of the remaining cards.

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:30.570
Technique plays a bigger role 
the longer it takes to reach them.

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:33.620
But later in the game,
when they start to come quicker,

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:36.360
is when Master Suo has the advantage.

00:09:37.170 --> 00:09:38.830
<i>I know that.</i>

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:42.130
<i>That's why I turned on
the turbo in the first half.</i>

00:09:42.130 --> 00:09:43.850
<i>I won't let him catch up!</i>

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:50.180
<i>Feel sorrow wash over me 
when I see the moon,</i>

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:52.650
<i>though autumn is not mine alone</i>

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:56.950
<i>"Game sense" is a remarkable little phrase.</i>

00:09:57.650 --> 00:10:01.950
<i>It felt as if the sound was a shining 
light in complete darkness.</i>

00:10:02.940 --> 00:10:06.770
<i>I sense a different light from each one.</i>

00:10:07.910 --> 00:10:10.390
<i>The world where that was more 
important than anything</i>

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:19.590
<b>53rd Queen Match</b>

00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:12.060
<i>was competitive karuta.</i>

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:19.590
<b>Master and Queen Matches</b>

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:16.510
<i>This is it. This is where 
I'll become number one.</i>

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:19.590
<b>55th Master Match</b>

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:18.600
<i>This is where I'll make something of myself!</i>

00:10:20.670 --> 00:10:21.520
<i>But...</i>

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:24.030
No way! He's too strong for me!

00:10:24.030 --> 00:10:25.550
I don't wanna play him!

