00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:37.950
<i>Then I'll try to win by 
20 cards instead of 25.</i>

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:38.830
<i>Boring.</i>

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:41.600
<i>I'll try winning by 17 today.</i>

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:42.980
<i>Boring.</i>

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:47.100
<i>Okay, I'll make my opponent
commit four faults today.</i>

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:48.380
<i>Boring.</i>

00:10:49.940 --> 00:10:52.170
<i>It's not that I like karuta.</i>

00:10:52.570 --> 00:10:54.830
<i>I'm hollow.</i>

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:58.110
<i>I have to feed on other people's passion.</i>

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:00.710
<i>I'm hollow.</i>

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:03.530
Master Suo's taken control!

00:11:03.530 --> 00:11:06.270
He took three cards in a row and,
following a dead card, just took his fourth!

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:08.020
The gap is shrinking!

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:09.940
His speed is incredible!

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:12.730
<i>Harada...</i>

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:21.910
<i>I have to feed on other people's passion...</i>

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:26.420
<i>if I want to keep going.</i>

00:11:26.420 --> 00:11:28.440
<i>The storm blasts autumn leaves...</i>

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:29.760
<i>He guarded it!</i>

00:11:29.760 --> 00:11:30.570
<i>Smooth!</i>

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:32.110
<i>Again!</i>

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:40.090
<i>I bet you expect me to get 
caught up in your pace.</i>

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:45.080
<i>I bet you think that speed and 
game sense are everything.</i>

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:50.100
<i>The fact that you're the Master 
makes the game of karuta cry.</i>

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:51.270
<i>I won't back down!</i>

00:11:51.900 --> 00:11:56.710
