than it is on me!</i>

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:33.220
<i>It's certainly hard on me, too...</i>

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:36.450
<i>But to earn points for 
the Shiranami Society,</i>

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:39.220
